00:02:04.650 --> 00:02:07.199
My book argues, No, that's wrong.

00:02:07.200 --> 00:02:09.089
The concerns are overstated.

00:02:09.090 --> 00:02:10.649
The solutions that these people

00:02:10.650 --> 00:02:12.809
offer are very bad, don't

00:02:12.810 --> 00:02:14.909
the.. From a range of not fixing

