to the, you know to the New York

00:54:44.430 --> 00:54:46.679
Times said, I found

00:54:46.680 --> 00:54:48.479
the book. The New York Times said

00:54:48.480 --> 00:54:50.099
Alexander Graham Bell should be hung

00:54:50.100 --> 00:54:52.109
